<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 7.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 7.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timetable for the sixth day</p>
<p>of competition at the world athletics championships on Thursday</p>
<p>(all times GMT):</p>
<p>0400 - Men's 50-km walk (start)</p>
<p>0520 - Women's long jump qualifying round, two groups</p>
<p>0530 - Women's javelin qualifying round, group A</p>
<p>0710 - Womens's javelin qualifying round, group B</p>
<p>0725 - Men's 50-km walk (finish)</p>
<p>1500 - Women's 10-km walk final</p>
<p>1510 - Women's discus final</p>
<p>1530 - Women's shot put final</p>
<p>1600 - Women's 200 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1625 - Men's 200 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1650 - Women's 800 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1720 - Women's 5,000 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1815 - Men's 110 metres hurdles final</p>
</text>
